[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b, 1c, 1d, 1e, 1f).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428224\">B2D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428610\">M1E</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428609\">M1D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428606\">M1A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428607\">M1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428221\">B2A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428223\">B2C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1f</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428222\">B2B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the left-threaded bolt securing the facia trim mount beam.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts securing the body computer/junction unit.</p><p>4. Move facia trim (4a) slightly and move body computer/junction\nunit (4b) downwards.</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connections (5a, 5b, 5c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5a</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428229\">B2H</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5b</p></td><td><p>Junction unit under dashboard</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428227\">B2F</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5c</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428612\">M1G</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5c</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428613\">M1H</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5c</p></td><td><p>Body computer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428614\">M1I</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Recover the body computer/junction unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045005.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Release the retainers (1a) , separate the junction unit (1b)\nfrom the body computer (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045006.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the junction unit and\nbody computer are undamaged.</p><p>At the bench, connect the junction unit\nfrom the body computer and attach the retainers.</p><p>Connect the rear electrical connections.</p><p>Position the unit and secure it using the\nbolts</p><p>Connect the front electrical connections.</p><p>Move the facia to the correct position\nand tighten the left facia beam bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FACIA TRIMMOUNT BEAM</p></td><td><p>M12 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p>If the body computer is being replaced,\nproceed as follows:</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the Body Computer is being\nreplaced the Parts Dept. must be asked, using the V.O.R. procedure and\nsupplying the vehicle chassis number, to provide an &#x27;identical copy&#x27;\nof the Body Computer: this copy will contain all the default settings entered\nfor the vehicle when new which are stored in the Parts database\nfor that chassis number.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>If the same body computer that was removed\nis being refitted on the vehicle, check that the system has not picked\nup any errors during the operation using the Examiner.</p><p>Test the electrical system.</p>"]]